      Data: SkyEngineAllEssenceComplete
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I shall remain here for a while to finish my research on those essence
        motes. Continue ahead, and locate the outpost where the first artifact is
        likely located. Meet me back at the <style=Engine>sky engine</style> in town
        once you have retrieved it.
