      Data: EssenceExplanation2
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: It appears, when an engine falters, the essence gathers into those blue
        motes you collected, which has set the <style=Engine>essence engine</style>
        right again. Most intriguing, hm?
