      Entry: 1
      Data: TalkWithSomeEssence
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I see you have already recovered some of the <style=Engine>sky essence</style>,
        most excellent! Yet the <style=Engine>essence engine</style> is not yet fully
        restored, and the path ahead remains broken. Recover the rest, and the path
        itself shall recover with it.
