      Data: EssenceExplanation
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Ah, yes. <style=Engine>Essence engines</style> are the most puzzling
        type of <style=Engine>sky engine</style>. My research suggests they are powered
        by a mysterious force I call <style=Engine>sky essence</style>.
