      Data: EssenceExplanation2
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: It appears, when an engine falters, the essence gathers into these blue
        motes. Collecting these scattered motes should be just what we need to set
        an <style=Engine>essence engine</style> right again. Most intriguing, hm?
